:DataTransformation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf :SyntheticDataTypes .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransitEvidence
:DataTransitEvidence rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf :SecurityAndPrivacyEvidence .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransmissionAndSharing
:DataTransmissionAndSharing rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf :HazardModes ;
                            rdfs:comment "The transfer and exchange of data between different systems, devices, or organizations are imperative in healthcare, where accurate and secure data transmission ensures patient safety and effective healthcare delivery. However, this process comes with risks such as transmission errors, data breaches, inconsistent formats, latency, which can compromise the reliability, security, and accuracy of healthcare data. Effective mitigation strategies such as robust encryption, standardized data formats, and real-time processing are required to minimize these risks." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransmissionAndSharingCauses
:DataTransmissionAndSharingCauses rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  rdfs:subClassOf :PotentialCauses .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransmissionAndSharingConsequences
:DataTransmissionAndSharingConsequences rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                        rdfs:subClassOf :Consequences .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransmissionAndSharingMitigations
:DataTransmissionAndSharingMitigations rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf :MitigationStrategies .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataTransmissionErrorsMitigation
:DataTransmissionErrorsMitigation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  rdfs:subClassOf :DataTransmissionAndSharingMitigations .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/DataUseAndInterpretation
:DataUseAndInterpretation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf :HazardModes ;
                          rdfs:comment "The stage of data use and interpretation is critical in healthcare as it directly influences clinical decisionmaking and patient outcomes. Despite accurate data collection and processing, hazards can arise when data is misinterpreted, overrelied upon, or used out of context. The risks include incorrect clinical decisions, patient harm, and loss of trust in datadriven systems. To ensure data is utilized effectively and safely, healthcare organizations must be aware of these hazards and implement strategies to mitigate them, thereby improving the quality of care and patient safety." .


