###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/MLMethods
:MLMethods rdf:type owl:Class ;
           rdfs:subClassOf :SyntheticDataGenerationMethods ;
           rdfs:comment "Machine learning methods and models have become fundamental tools across various applications, ranging from data analysis and prediction to synthetic data generation. Synthetic data generation, in particular, has seen significant advancements through the development of various ML techniques, categorized into basic and generative AI models. Each of these approaches offers unique benefits and addresses specific challenges in creating high-quality synthetic data. Here, we explore these methods in depth with insights from state-of-the-art literature" .


