                     rdfs:comment "which is a linear regression model applied to continuous variables, and aK-nearest neighboring model is applied to categorical variables, full black-box attack, partial black-box attack, white-boxgradient attack, white-box discriminator attack, and DOMIAS, which is a density-based Membership Inference Attack(MIA)." .


