###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/ChiSquaredTest
:ChiSquaredTest rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                         :ReproductibilityMetrics ,
                         :StatisticalTests ,
                         :ValidityMetrics ;
                :HasModality :TabularData ;
                rdfs:comment "Chi-Square test between the five independent outputs to compute the correlations across the generated sd to assessreproducibility." ,
                             "For categorical data, the Chi squared test can be used to test whether the frequency of categories in synthetic and real features are similar. The test statistic is derived from the frequency of categories in synthetic and real features. Next to categorical data, the test can also be used for numerical data after adequate binning." ,
                             "Statistical test for categorical attributes." .


