:DimensionWisePrediction-DWP rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                      :CorrelationStructure ,
                                      :FidelityMetrics ,
                                      :RealismMetrics ,
                                      :UtilityMetrics ;
                             :HasModality :TabularData ,
                                          :TimeSeriesData ;
                             rdfs:comment "Dimension-wise Prediction: To investigate the multivariate correlation structure of synthetic data, perform dimension-wise prediction on synthetic versus real data. This involves iteratively predicting each feature from all other features and assessing accuracy differences between synthetic and real data. If accuracy is similar, multivariate correlations are retained well in synthetic data." .


