###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/FDA21CFRPart11Standard
:FDA21CFRPart11Standard rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                 :FDARegulations .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ek279783/ontologies/2025/8/ontologySD/FDA21CFRPart820_QualitySystemRegulationStandard
